{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30560","headline":"及第送潘图归宜春 · 卢肇","name":"及第送潘图归宜春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三载皇都恨食贫，北溟今日化穷鳞。\n青云乍喜逢知己，白社犹悲送故人。\n对酒共惊千里别，看花自感一枝春。\n君归爲说龙门寺，雷雨初生电遶身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢肇","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30560.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30560","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}